  "details": "I thought this idea for a while mainly because I want older computers run vrchat effectively so the best idea is give ability for players to disable their own model and its a desktop only feature. \n\n(Mainly because in VR the player is required to see themselves and it makes no sense if not)\n\nOf course the mirrors and cameras wouldn't be able to see yourself so tell the player camera to disable the rendering of the local player so the computer won't have to render so many triangles.\n\nThis won't affect the mirror and camera features because they have their own rendering.\n\nAlso if this feature gets implemented I hope it would be in graphics or avatar (Disable self-rendering.)",
